From 9e83aba8820cab70b2c707474103534b8e4752cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (for Kush)" <kushisthecoolest@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 22:55:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] linux: src/dxvk syntax-clean except two files; FD interop
 export

- FD external memory/semaphore export and import (VK_KHR_external_*_fd),
  ray tracing extensions no longer gated on _WIN64.
- Headless replacements: ImGui platform backend, file watch, Reflex,
  overlay window, NRC/NVAPI SDK stubs, system info, DDS mmap loading.
- Aftermath compiled out (REMIX_NO_AFTERMATH), Reflex (REMIX_NO_REFLEX).
- Fixes: async texture loader started without RTX IO, case-correct
  include paths, GCC/Clang conformance (shadowed template parameters,
  defaulted nested-type arguments, ambiguous vec3 brace assignment,
  default_random_engine differences, std::sqrtf/roundf).
- remix_c.h: native POSIX export macros and 64-bit check.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tb41TgDi74v7sgH5LJBZ5A
Signed-off-by: Claude (for Kush) <kushisthecoolest@gmail.com>
